; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788610468534_img_1788610471160_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif;\">&nbsp;</span>Gael Monfils, the charismatic French tennis star, knows his time in the game is short. Come the end of the season, he plans to retire, ending a career as one of the most talented players of his generation never to win a major.</p><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">But before he walks away, he has one last reasonable shot at a Grand Slam title—and he could do it alongside his wife.</p>','Lifestyle','[\"Health\",\"Mental Health\",\"Soccer\",\"Tennis\",\"Travel\"]','Home - Main Bottom Panel','Oshidi','writer@gmail.com','Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A3000%2Fapi%2Fwebp-proxy%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Ff005.backblazeb2.com%252Ffile%252F