t strategic direction.” Still, they say, the appointment does not necessarily mean a “wholesale deprioritization of Creative,” but suggests that Adobe “could now be attempting to turn CX orchestration into a larger growth and monetization engine for enterprises.” Adobe shares trade down 6.4%. (elias.schisgall@wsj.com)</span>','Business','[\"Currencies\",\"Markets & Finance\",\"Entrepreneurship\",\"Corporate News\",\"Congress\"]','None (Category and Search Only)','Yapa','writer1@gmail.com','Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788611904929_img_1788611908062_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788612161587,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-09-05 12:38:28','2026-09-05 12:48:18'),('1788611992391','Democrats Criticize Fetterman After WSJ Report on How He Spends His Time','1788611992391','Plus, the DOJ told its antitrust division to pause work with Canada, and diesel hits an all-time high','1. Democratic lawmakers and activists criticized John Fetterman after a WSJ report found he has been shirking his duties as a U.S. senator for Pennsylvania.“202...','<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788611992391_img_1788611995675_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><h4 data-type=\"hed\" class=\"css-1cpfs5z-Smallhed e1oou4m30\" style=\"--headline-font-color: #222222; --headline-link-hover-color: #0274b6; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Retina, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span>1. Democratic lawmakers and activists criticized John Fetterman after a WSJ report found he has been shirking his duties as a U.S. senator for Pennsylvania.</h4><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">“<a data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/democrats-assail-fetterman-after-wsj-report-9a60e499?mod=article_inline\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1), cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">2028 can’t come soon enough</a>,” said Pennsylvania state Rep. Malcolm Kenyatta, who is also a vice chair of the Democratic National Committee. The Journal’s reporting, based on text messages from the senator and interviews with former staffers and others, <a data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/john-fetterman-little-interest-senator-be74e7a3?mod=article_inline\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1), cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">showed he has little interest</a> in meeting with constituents, attending in-state events or sitting through Senate hearings. Short on time? <a data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/policy/takeaways-from-wsjs-reporting-on-john-fetterman-2b43e666?mod=article_inline\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1), cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Read our key takeaways</a>.</p>','Business','[\"Politics\",\"Criminal Cases\",\"International News\",\"News\",\"U.S. News\"]','None (Category and Search Only)','Yapa','writer1@gmail.com','Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788611992391_img_1788611995675_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788612140902,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-09-05 12:39:58','2026-09-05 12:48:18'),('1788612054956','Record Fuel Prices Pose Fresh Challenge for Trump Ahead of Midterms','1788612054956','Diesel hits an average $5.85 a gallon on Friday, an all-time high that surpasses the previous record from 2022','President Trump came into office pledging to lower energy prices for Americans. Instead, he is presiding over a historic run-up in fuel prices. Diesel prices hi...','<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788612054956_img_1788612057487_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif;\">&nbsp;</span>President Trump came into office pledging to <a data-type=\"link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/economy/central-banking/donald-trump-energy-interest-rates-312cfc24?mod=article_inline\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ekxajjj0 css-i0lbhy-OverridedLink\" style=\"display: inline; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); text-decoration: none; transition-property: color, fill; transition-duration: 200ms, 200ms; transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1), cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.5, 1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">lower energy prices</a> for Americans. Instead, he is presiding over a historic run-up in fuel prices.&nbsp;</p><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Diesel prices hit an average $5.85 a gallon on Friday, according to OPIS, a Dow Jones company. It is a new record that surpasses the previous one from 2022, when Russia’s invasion of Ukraine sent energy markets into a tailspin.</p>','Business','[\"Law\",\"Legal Affairs\",\"World Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Small Business\"]','None (Category and Search Only)','Yapa','writer1@gmail.com','Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788612054956_img_1788612057487_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788612133702,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-09-05 12:40:59','2026-09-05 12:48:18'),('17