svg__a\"></use></svg></span></a></span>&nbsp;Athletica cut its outlook for the second time this year following another quarter of declining sales in its Americas business.</p><p data-type=\"paragraph\" data=\"[object Object]\" class=\"css-1qg6i2u e1hwu21o0\" style=\"--summary-font-color: #555555; --summary-bullet-small-font-color: #222222; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); direction: ltr; font-family: Exchange, Georgia, serif; line-height: calc(1.55556); margin: 0px 0px 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The activewear retailer said Thursday it now expects annual sales to be $10.35 billion to $10.5 billion, down from its previous guidance of $11 billion to $11.15 billion. It also lowered its projection for earnings per share for the year to $9.48 to $9.73, down from $10.95 to $11.15.</p>','News','[\"Congress\",\"Business\"]',NULL,'Yapa','writer1@gmail.com','Pending review','/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Fthumb_1788614814187.webp',NULL,'[\"dfg\",\"sdfg\"]','5 min read',0,1788614821773,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-09-05 13:27:00','2026-09-05 13:54:38'),('1788616437664','Health Care Roundup: Market Talk','1788616437664','sdfg',NULL,'<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788616437664_img_1788616584981_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure>&nbsp;erytuiu&nbsp; r6dtyui w','World Politics','[\"International News\"]','Home - Top News','Yapa',NULL,'Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A3000%2Fapi%2Fwebp-proxy%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Ff005.backblazeb2.com%252Ffile%252Ftimeschicago%252Farticles%252Farticle_1788616437664_img_1788616584981_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788830122842,'Sep 8, 2026','2026-09-05 13:54:38','2026-09-08 01:18:23'),('1788829680152','Jeju Police Officer Arrested After 298 Missing-Person Cases Come Under Scrutiny','1788829680152','A case involving two people later found dead has exposed a much wider problem, prompting authorities to review every missing-person report handled by the officer.',NULL,'<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_1788829680152_img_1788829680225_0.webp\" alt=\"qw\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-style: italic; color: #475569; margin-right: 12px;\">qw</span><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-family: monospace; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; margin-left: auto; text-align: right;\">(PHOTO: ER)</span></div></figure><p style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span>A missing-person case is supposed to trigger a search for answers. On South Korea\'s Jeju Island, authorities are now investigating how one police officer came to handle </span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\"><a href=\"https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20260823000500315\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(234, 88, 12); text-decoration: underline;\">298 missing-person reports</a></span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">, after allegations that he improperly closed cases without properly confirming that people were safe.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 12pt 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; line-height: 1.38; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">The officer, identified by his surname </span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\"><a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/south-korea-missing-persons-jeju-island-police-06245925fbc7db3698482399d20cc9dc\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(234, 88, 12); text-decoration: underline;\">Bu</a></span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">, was arrested on </span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">August 25, 2026</span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">, on allegations including dereliction of duty, falsifying official electronic records and obstructing official duties. He has denied the allegations, although police said he later partially admitted to falsely telling the boyfriend of one missing woman that he had contacted her and confirmed she was safe.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 12pt 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; line-height: 1.38; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">The scandal began to unravel after two missing-person cases handled by Bu were found to have been closed prematurely. One involved </span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">37-year-old Jang Mi-ran</span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">, who disappeared in May. Police later found a body believed to be hers on August 24, around </span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">104 days after she went missing</span><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">. Investigators found no call records supporting Bu\'s claim that he had spoken with her.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 12pt 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; line-height: 1.38; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">Another case involved a man in his 60s who had also been reported missing. His body was found after the case had allegedly been closed without proper confirmation of his safety.</span></p>','Business','[\"News\",\"Celebrity\",\"Architecture\",\"Books\",\"Entertainment\"]','Home - Top News','Writer User',NULL,'Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A3000%2Fapi%2Fwebp-proxy%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Ff005.backblazeb2.com%252Ffile%252Ftimeschicago%252Farticles%252Farticle_1788829680152_img_1788829680225_0.webp',NULL,'[\"sd\"]','5 min read',0,1788830041389,'Sep 8, 2026','2026-09-08 01:08:04','2026-09-08 01:15:00'),('1788830298058','Man Arrested Over Death of Former UK Politician Ann Widdecombe','1788830298058','A 28-year-old man has been arrested on suspicion of murdering former British politician Ann Widdecombe, according to police in England.','reform qww rjfbe The suspect, described by authorities as a white British national, was arrested on Saturday evening in South Yorkshire and remains in police cu...','<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://f005.backblazeb2.com/file/timeschicago/articles/article_1788830298058_img_1788830301504_0.webp\" alt=\"reform qww rjfbe \" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-style: italic; color: #475569; margin-right: 12px;\">reform qww rjfbe </span></div></figure><p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"400\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span>The suspect, described by authorities as a <span data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"282\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">white British national</span>, was arrested on Saturday evening in <span data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"339\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">South Yorkshire</span> and remains in police custody while investigations continue.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.75 !important;\"></span></p><h3 data-section-id=\"2fj2ac\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"429\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Investigation Continues</span></h3><p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"545\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">In a statement, <span data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"476\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Devon and <a href=\"https://news.devon-cornwall.police.uk/news-article/3e2d22d4-787d-f111-9d98-6045bdd24049\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(234, 88, 12); text-decoration: underline;\">Cornwall Police</a></span><a href=\"https://news.devon-cornwall.police.uk/news-article/3e2d22d4-787d-f111-9d98-6045bdd24049\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(234, 88, 12); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\"> confirmed</a> the arrest and said Widdecombe\'s family had been informed.</p><p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"686\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">The force also stated that officers were assisted by Counter Terrorism Policing North East and South Yorkshire Police during the operation.</p><p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"774\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Investigators have said there is <span data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"746\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">currently no evidence</span> suggesting the killing was:</p><ul data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"820\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px 0px 1.25rem; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify;\"><li data-section-id=\"2ghlsz\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"796\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">An act of terrorism</li><li data-section-id=\"1g1baw9\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"820\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.75 !important;\">Politically motivated</li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1d7u3pv\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"855\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Widdecombe Found Dead at Home</span></h3><p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"939\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Widdecombe, 78, was discovered dead at her home in <span data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"925\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Haytor, Devon</span>, on Thursday.</p><p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1038\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Police believe she died the previous day and reported that she had suffered <span data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1037\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">serious injuries</span>.</p>','Business','[\"Law\",\"World Politics\",\"Elections\"]','Home - Top News','writer1','writer1@gmail.com','Published','https://f005.backblazeb2.com/file/timeschicago/articles/article_1788830298058_img_1788830301504_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788830333799,'Sep 8, 2026','2026-09-08 01:18:23','2026-09-08 01:18:53'),('1788830456329','US Senator Lindsey Graham Dies at 71 After Sudden Illness','1788830456329','Republican Senator Lindsey Graham, one of President Donald Trump\'s closest political allies and one of Washington\'s most influential foreign-policy voices, has died at the age of 71.','According to his office, Graham died on Saturday evening following a \"brief and sudden illness.\" Reports indicate that emergency personnel responded to a medica...','<figure style=\"float: left; margin: 8px 24px 16px 0px; width: 450px; clear: left; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://f005.backblazeb2.com/file/timeschicago/articles/article_1788830456329_img_1788830456397_0.webp\" alt=\"Article image\" style=\"width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" data-webp-converted=\"true\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; font-family: sans-serif; width: 100%;\"></div></figure><p style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: &quot;Encorpada Classic Compressed Bold&quot;, &quot;Escrow Display Condensed Bold&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display Fallback&quot;, &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span>According to his office, Graham died on Saturday evening following a <span data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"355\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">\"brief and sudden illness.\"</span> Reports indicate that emergency personnel responded to a medical emergency at his Washington, D.C., residence after reports of cardiac arrest.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"dyfl4d\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"536\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; text-align: justify;\">Sudden Death After Ukraine Visit</h3><p data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"726\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Graham had recently returned from <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c4gyjpkzew1o\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(234, 88, 12); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\"><span data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"594\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bolder;\">Volodymyr Zelensky</span>\'s </a>office in Kyiv, where he met the Ukrainian president on Friday. There had been no publicly known health concerns before the trip.</p><p data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"803\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">President Trump said he had spoken with Graham only hours before his death.</p><blockquote data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"880\" style=\"border-width: 0px 0px 0px 4px; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor currentcolor rgb(234, 88, 12); margin: 1.5rem 0px; padding: 0.5rem 0px 0.5rem 1.25rem; color: rgb(71, 85, 105); background-color: rgb(250, 250, 249); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify;\"><p data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"880\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-justify: inter-word; width: 892px; max-width: 100%;\">\"He sounded great, maybe a little tired, but great,\" Trump told NBC News.</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"962\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Trump described Graham as a \"true American patriot\" who would be greatly missed.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1r6kij2\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1001\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif; text-align: justify;\">From Trump Critic to Trusted Ally</h3><p data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1072\" style=\"border-color: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word; width: 916px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 17px; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-family: Lora, Georgia, serif;\">Graham\'s relationship with Trump evolved dramatically over the years.</p>','World Politics','[\"International News\",\"Congress\"]','None (Category and Search Only)','qwert','qwert@gmail.com','Published','https://f005.backblazeb2.com/file/timeschicago/articles/article_1788830456329_img_1788830456397_0.webp',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788830524171,'Sep 8, 2026','2026-09-08 01:20:59','2026-09-08 01:22:04'),('pending_1788583594138','Writer1 Breakthrough Tech Innovation Review Article','pending_1788583594138','Tech review content...','Tech review content...','<p>Pending review body for writer1@gmail.com</p>','Tech','[]','None (Category and Search Only)','writer1','writer1@gmail.com','Drafts','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?fm=webp&fit=crop&w=800&q=80',NULL,'[]','5 min read',0,1788586413887,'Sep 5, 2026','2026-09-05 04:46:34','2026-09-08 01:11:26'),('post_live_test_1788578232555','Backblaze B2 Upload Live Verification Article','b2-upload-live-verification',NULL,NULL,'<p>Hello world!</p><img src=\"/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Farticle_post_live_test_1788578232555_img_1788578235080_0.png\" alt=\"Test inline\" />','Business','[]',NULL,'Chicago Writer','writer@gmail.com','Published','/api/webp-proxy?url=https%3A%2F%2Ff005.backblazeb2.com%2Ffile%2Ftimeschicago%2Farticles%2Fthumb_post_live_test_1788578232555.png',NULL,'[]',NULL,0,1788578238327,NULL,'2026-09-05 03:17:18','2026-09-05 04:34:33');
